cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on these notes, please credit them as below and link back to the repository."
type: software
title: "Steam Frame developer notes"
abstract: >-
  Unofficial developer documentation for the Steam Frame VR headset's
  operating system (SteamOS, codename Deckard): OpenXR runtime, graphics,
  audio, network services, D-Bus APIs, SteamVR tooling, hardware access,
  controllers, power, wireless, compatibility layers, developer workflow,
  systemd services, kernel, boot sequence and firmware. Every statement is based on something observed
  read-only on a retail headset.
authors:
  - alias: lostpanda85
    website: "https://github.com/lostpanda85"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lostpanda85/frame-docs"
url: "https://lostpanda85.github.io/frame-docs/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Steam Frame
  - SteamOS
  - SteamVR
  - Valve
  - Deckard
  - VR headset
  - developer documentation
  - Linux
  - D-Bus
  - U-Boot
  - firmware
